  "id": "quinoa-with-vegetables",
  "name": "Quinoa with Vegetables",
  "subtitle": "A savory quinoa side with peppers, corn, and herbs",
  "description": "Tender quinoa is combined with sautéed garlic, bell pepper, corn, and green onions for a colorful vegetable side dish.",
